<title>MEXICO: GFMulti 1996 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>GFMulti 1996 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Multiva Grupo Financiero SA (GFMulti) said its 1996 net profits were 30.27 million pesos versus a loss of 192.73 million during 1995.</p>
<p>Revenues of the controlling group, excluding subsidiaries, were 17 million pesos versus 79.05 million pesos the year before, the company said in information released by the Mexican Stock Exchange (Bolsa).</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
